{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"xiaoyifang.GoldenDict-ng","latestVersion":"26.11.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"The Next Generation GoldenDict. A feature-rich open-source dictionary lookup program, supporting multiple dictionary formats and online dictionaries.","license":"GPL-3.0-or-later","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/xiaoyifang/goldendict-ng/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.txt","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"The Next Generation GoldenDict. A feature-rich open-source dictionary lookup program, supporting multiple dictionary formats and online dictionaries.","license":"GPL-3.0-or-later","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/xiaoyifang/goldendict-ng/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.txt","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"GoldenDict-ng is an advanced dictionary lookup program.\nFeatures\n- Supports many dictionary formats, such as MDX, DSL, StarDict, Zim...\n- Presents lookup results of multiple dictionaries in the same page\n- Supports special types of \"dictionaries\", such as external program, website, audio files...\n- Lots of auxiliary features\n  - Popup window\n  - Full text search\n  - Anki integration\n  - Transliteration for some languages\n  - Word stemming and spelling correction via Hunspell's morphology analysis\n  - Unicode case, diacritics, punctuation and whitespace folding (e.g. typing 'Grussen' would yield 'grüßen' in German dictionaries).\n  - ...","name":"goldendict-ng","packageUrl":"https://xiaoyifang.github.io/goldendict-ng/","publisher":"Humanity","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/xiaoyifang","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/xiaoyifang/goldendict-ng/releases/tag/v26.11.0","tags":["dict","dictionary","goldendict","mdict","translate","translation"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"新一代 GoldenDict。一款功能丰富的开源词典查询工具，支持多种词典格式及在线词典服务。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"GoldenDict-ng 是一款高级词典查询工具。\n功能特点\n- 支持多种词典格式，如 MDX、DSL、StarDict、Zim...\n- 在同一页面展示多部词典的查询结果\n- 支持特殊类型的“词典”，如外部程序、网站、音频文件...\n- 丰富的辅助功能\n  - 弹出窗口\n  - 全文检索\n  - Anki 集成\n  - 部分语言的音译转换\n  - 通过 Hunspell 形态分析实现的词干提取和拼写校正\n  - Unicode 大小写、变音符号、标点和空格折叠（例如在德语词典中输入“Grussen”会显示“grüßen”）\n  - ...","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/xiaoyifang/goldendict-ng/releases/tag/v26.11.0","tags":["goldendict","mdict","翻译","词典"]}},"longDescription":"GoldenDict-ng is an advanced dictionary lookup program.\nFeatures\n- Supports many dictionary formats, such as MDX, DSL, StarDict, Zim...\n- Presents lookup results of multiple dictionaries in the same page\n- Supports special types of \"dictionaries\", such as external program, website, audio files...\n- Lots of auxiliary features\n  - Popup window\n  - Full text search\n  - Anki integration\n  - Transliteration for some languages\n  - Word stemming and spelling correction via Hunspell's morphology analysis\n  - Unicode case, diacritics, punctuation and whitespace folding (e.g. typing 'Grussen' would yield 'grüßen' in German dictionaries).\n  - ...","name":"goldendict-ng","packageUrl":"https://xiaoyifang.github.io/goldendict-ng/","publisher":"Humanity","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/xiaoyifang","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/xiaoyifang/goldendict-ng/releases/tag/v26.11.0","tags":["dict","dictionary","goldendict","mdict","translate","translation"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/26.11.0/app.json","detailSha256":"0f471948cb58d984375af1973042e5efb6bcec48d0edfca3b7eebf8d6fb59c20","releaseDate":"2026-10-23","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"26.11.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/26.8.0/app.json","detailSha256":"9b8cd6b6dc96b267140d8eb924b0164c098acff5a80b112954d0b18275b72d77","releaseDate":"2026-08-05","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"26.8.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/26.6.2/app.json","detailSha256":"aef8fbafa966821b8e68745af29e6d1ca503030cde5ea54fd03b0a10cdaf4138","releaseDate":"2026-07-10","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"26.6.2"},{"architectures":["x